177
00:08:50,710 --> 00:08:50,930
Right.

178
00:08:50,930 --> 00:08:53,150
So he's talking about golf, but he lost his thread.

179
00:08:53,330 --> 00:08:55,550
So then he doesn't remember what he was talking about.

180
00:08:55,810 --> 00:08:56,850
Okay, very good.

181
00:08:57,290 --> 00:09:00,810
