184
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:14,800
Well, this is a really great way to answer a question you don't actually know how to answer.

185
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:21,440
In this case, Mr. Ford doesn't have the answer to this, this audience member's question, like you said, Marco.

186
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:24,440
