All right.

214
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:06,190
This phrase to take five is very, very common in English.

215
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:10,320
And it's just another way to say, can we take a five minute break?

216
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:14,810
